WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.670
Hey guys, it's Jan here.

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:08.610
I absolutely loved the epic trailer for Suicide
Squad and quite frankly I cannot wait until

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:13.080
August rolls around and we finally get to
see the worst of the worst up there in all

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.749
their glory on the big screen!

00:00:14.749 --> 00:00:19.510
There's been some crazy reports of what went
down on set during the movie's shoot too,

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:25.520
so I wanted to look at 7 of the most insane,
crazy, WTF facts so far about the Suicide

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.570
Squad movie!

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.770
According to Ike Barinholtz, who's best known
for The Mindy Project and the Neigbors movies

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:37.059
with Zac Efron and Seth Rogen, Suicide Squad
director David Ayer loves to really mess with

00:00:37.059 --> 00:00:42.129
his actors' minds before they start filming,
telling them all sorts of crazy stuff to get

00:00:42.129 --> 00:00:45.239
them into the dark place he wants them in
for their character.

00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:49.220
Barinholtz, whose Suicide Squad character
is yet to be revealed, says that Ayer used

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.969
a similar trick on his last movie, Fury, and
it very nearly ended in a fight between Shia

00:00:53.969 --> 00:00:55.969
LaBeouf and Jon Bernthal.

00:00:55.969 --> 00:01:00.530
And during Cara Delevingne's audition for
Suicide Squad's Enchantress, David Ayer riled

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:06.120
up Delevingne so much that she says she wanted
to kill someone by the time she left!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:11.070
And precisely because Ayer insisted his actors
went to all the traumatic places they needed

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:15.400
to go to really bring their characters to
vivid life, the director had a therapist brought

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:19.620
on set for the cast, according to Adam Beach,
who plays Slipknot in the movie,

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:24.320
Well, not exactly, a therapist, but a life
coach who's a friend of Ayer's was there to

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:28.390
make sure none of the cast took their psychotic
work home with them!

00:01:28.390 --> 00:01:33.800
As for Jared Leto, who plays The Joker, he
stayed in character while filming the entire

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:38.180
movie, just as he did for his Oscar-winning
turn in the movie Dallas Buyers Club.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:42.930
Will Smith, who plays Deadshot, said that
Leto never spoke a single word to Smith as

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:46.020
himself during the whole six-month shoot.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:50.270
According to Suicide Squad producer Charles
Roven, Leto isolated himself from the rest

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:54.900
of the cast, which actually helped the Suicide
Squad gang to bond, and on top of that, Leto

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.310
wouldn't come to set unless the crew called
him Mr J.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:05.220
In fact, Jared Leto has taken his method acting
to a whole new level on Suicide Squad, sending

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.110
his cast-mates a bunch of disturbing gifts.

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:12.640
Leto sent his co-stars who were in rehearsals
at the time a video of himself in character

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:16.620
telling them he was sorry not to be there
but was working just as hard as they were.

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:21.560
For Margot Robbie, whose Harley Quinn character
is The Joker's lover in the comic books, Leto

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:25.030
sent a love letter plus a box with a live
rat inside!

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:29.510
Will Smith also got a letter from The Joker
actor, but his one was accompanied by bullets!

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:33.880
And what does a method actor playing one of
DC's greatest villains get his cast-mates

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:34.980
as a group gift?

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.140
A dead pig, of course!

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:43.260
Margot Robbie really got into her crazy Harley
Quinn character setting up her own Tattoo

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:46.920
Parlour and inking the word Skwad on to her
co-stars' arms.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:51.260
Will Smith also had a go at tattooing Joel
Kinnamon, who plays Suicide Squad leader Rick

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:52.260
Flagg.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:57.430
However, apparently tattooing isn't one of
Smith's many talents, in fact, to quote Kinnamon,

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:01.930
'it was like watching a drunk baby fly a helicopter'!

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:06.209
But when it comes to having a blast on set,
Will Smith definitely is your man.

00:03:06.209 --> 00:03:10.900
When an all-night shoot meant the cast and
crew missed the Manny Pacquiao-Floyd Mayweather

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:16.350
fight, Smith took care of business, arranging
for three cinema screens to be set up so everyone

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:20.910
could watch the fight the next day during
lunch and on top of that he hired a restaurant

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.860
to cater for all 500 people!

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:29.410
And not content with his boxing match endeavours,
Will Smith also pumped up the volume along

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:33.940
with the tempo and threw a party for the cast
and crew including a special concert with

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.030
none other than DJ Jazzy Jeff.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.430
The guys performed ten songs together.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:41.890
Doubtless a good bit of practice for their
2016 reunion tour!

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:45.530
So, guys, what are you looking forward to
most about Suicide Squad?

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:48.340
What kind of Joker do you think Jared Leto's
going to make?

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:52.280
And are there any other crazy things you're
heard about the movie and its stars?

